# ── T-11483 — the IN-LAND re-audit (SPEC-0077 §3a audit currency, the rebaseline arm) ──────────
# THE MEASURED PROBLEM. `_change_is_audited` above already runs POST-merge — it is called from
# `_land_integrate` with `merged_base`, after step-2 update-from-main. What does NOT run post-merge
# is the AUDIT it judges: the audit-post was taken PRE-QUEUE, on the pre-merge branch tree. So the
# gate asks a post-merge question of a pre-merge answer, and every peer that lands during the queue
# wait invalidates it. task/T-11444 was refused three times on 2026-08-23 — after 0784f61, then
# d1b078e, then 490cfb0 — each time following a GREEN audit-post, each time because a sibling
# landed while it waited. The T-9543 concurrent-merge-churn carve-out cannot reach this class: its
# baseline is `merge-base HEAD main`, the ABSORBED main, deliberately so (T-10014), while the
# refusing drift arrives from commits pulled in AT LAND TIME.
#
# THE FIX IS A MOMENT, NOT A TOLERANCE. followup fu_e9edf59a86ca analysed this exact refusal and
# ruled the obvious fix OUT: an ordinary land tolerates main moving under it (`merge_inherited`),
# a re-baseline deliberately does not, because a waiver is being granted and the auditor must have
# seen what will actually reach main — "a defensible rule, it is not a bug and should not be fixed
# by weakening it". Nothing here weakens it. What the same note left open is what this implements:
# take the audit INSIDE the land, over the MERGED tree, so the auditor sees exactly what reaches
# main and there is no window for a peer to invalidate it. The audit sees a SUPERSET of what the
# pre-queue audit saw (the pre-merge branch tree plus everything main added), never less.
#
# THIS FUNCTION NEVER ADMITS ANYTHING. It is a CLASSIFIER over a CLOSED four-value vocabulary; the
# admission decision stays entirely with the UNCHANGED `_change_is_audited` gate the caller runs
# immediately after it. That is deliberate — `lessons/carving-an-exception-into-a-fail-closed-gate`
# §1: a relaxation must rest on POSITIVE evidence, and the positive evidence here is the gate's own
# verdict on a real audit record, not this function's opinion.
_INLAND_REAUDIT_MAX_PER_LAND = 1


