                    # every other pre-integrate refusal. The caller-facing contract stays the ONE
                    # shipped `^LAND: (OK|ABORT)` token (SPEC-0180 rule 2c): no third token shape.
                    #
                    # THE CONSUME'S RETURN VALUE IS LOAD-BEARING (consult round-6 finding C4). A land
